WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:04.337
It's called the 
Hare Krishna movement.

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:07.257
A colorful group,

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:11.011
often seen dancing and 
chanting in the streets.

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:15.890
What most Americans think 
when they hear Hare Krishna is

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:18.476
peaceful people.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:24.733
Nothing about 
making someone disappear.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.696
This is the case

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.031
that's probably 
going to be with me 

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:31.906
for the rest of my life.

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:38.371
There are two worlds.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:41.374
The material world
and the spiritual world.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:44.502
You have these young, 

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:46.671
immature people suddenly

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:48.590
acquiring this absolute power

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:50.550
over other human beings.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:53.595
Keith Ham wanted to 
take over the movement.

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:58.058
Manipulative, power hungry.

00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:00.310
He was the devil incarnate.

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:04.731
My father said
he's not a real guru

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:07.901
and my family was destroyed.

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:10.153
It's a whodunit.

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:12.030
Why did this guy get shot?

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.865
And he's connected to the Krishnas

00:01:13.865 --> 00:01:15.033
in West Virginia.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.579
I promised that I would 
stay for 6 months

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:22.665
and didn't get out for 11 years.

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:25.752
Just like the mob.

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.296
You can't have a snitch.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:33.384
You didn't go 
against Keith Ham.

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:37.555
If you did...

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:39.766
we didn't hear from you again.

